menu "Detector recording"

    config FY_ENCOUNTER_ABSENCE_S
        int "Seconds of silence that close an encounter"
        default 60
        range 5 3600
        help
            Repeated sightings of one device belong to the same encounter
            until it goes unseen for this long. To be validated for driving,
            walking, and stationary use.

    config FY_ENCOUNTER_CHECKPOINT_S
        int "Rewrite interval for a changing encounter (s)"
        default 60
        range 10 3600
        help
            An open encounter that has changed is rewritten at most this
            often, which bounds what an abrupt power cut can lose.

    config FY_BATTERY_LOG_INTERVAL_S
        int "Battery sample interval (s)"
        default 60
        range 10 3600
        help
            Interval between stored battery samples on boards that can
            measure a battery. Used to characterise charge and discharge.

    config FY_STORAGE_WARN_PERCENT
        int "Storage use that triggers an offload warning (%)"
        default 90
        range 50 99

endmenu
